{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p></p>\n<p>誰說長途旅行一定要花大錢買商務艙？特選經濟艙一樣能讓你享受高CP值的舒適飛行！今次帶大家開箱座位與飛機餐飲，看看值不值得！\n</p>\n<p>翻新後的客機座位明顯寬敞不少，配備小腿靠墊、腳踏及可調校頭枕，長途機睡覺輕鬆很多。前方設有15.6吋4K螢幕並支援藍牙連接個人耳機，看電影超享受。餐飲同樣有誠意，除了多款主菜，更有迎賓飲品與餐後雪糕！相比價格更高的商務艙，這個選擇會是你的長途機新歡嗎？留言分享你的首選！</p>\n<p>達人帶路 ｜ 旅遊唔想做功課？跟住我哋出發就啱！由各路旅遊達人帶你玩轉世界角落，全方位為你搜羅最新最熱門旅遊情報。如果你都想同大家開心Share，就即刻DM我哋啦！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957808806794694_14728214816b0971114f4be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.gotrip.hk/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17957808806794694_14728214816b0971114f4be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：@addison.urlauber)</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DgPea6Sz5RM/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/ig%e7%b2%be%e9%81%b8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">IG精選</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e5%9c%8b%e6%b3%b0%e8%88%aa%e7%a9%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">國泰航空</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%89%b9%e9%81%b8%e7%b6%93%e6%bf%9f%e8%89%99/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">特選經濟艙</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%95%b7%e9%80%94%e6%a9%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">長途機</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：@addison.urlauber資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DgPea6Sz5RM/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Gotrip IG</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生活</a>\nNov 27 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T12:24:15.474022+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"c